Web|Burp Suite|burpsuite|gui|The industry-standard web proxy: intercept, repeater, intruder. (GUI)|
Web|OWASP ZAP|zaproxy|gui|Free full web app scanner & intercepting proxy. (GUI)|
Wireless|wifite|wifite|tui|Automated Wi-Fi auditing — walks you through WPA/WEP/WPS attacks end-to-end.|sudo wifite -i wlan1
Wireless|airodump-ng|airodump-ng|tui|Live capture & survey of nearby APs and clients; grabs WPA handshakes.|sudo airodump-ng wlan1mon
