Utility|macchanger|macchanger|cli|Spoof/randomize your MAC before touching a network.|sudo macchanger -r wlan1
Utility|proxychains4|proxychains4|cli|Force any tool through a SOCKS/HTTP proxy chain (pivot via SSH/Tor).|proxychains4 nmap -sT TARGET
Utility|socat|socat|cli|Multipurpose relay — upgrade shells, forward ports, bridge sockets.|socat file:$(tty),raw,echo=0 tcp-listen:4444
Utility|netcat|nc|cli|The TCP/UDP Swiss-army knife — listeners, banners, quick shells.|nc -lvnp 4444
